{
  "format": "story-pages-v1",
  "source_pdf": "downloads/wukongs-slippy-slide-skates-v3-zh-Hans.pdf",
  "source_sha256": "b2306e71548c6938ec64eca3504af3063bc8c068788fed774fd6e13a7be7c943",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "687b990c182a95a0186da5749b862d45c0d17e42d703182a7926b29560c9732c",
      "text": "悟空\n学滑冰",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "4f471b8fb2d71a818ede08125ca3991d565d1782e2e01baa6860e6bcccb65838",
      "text": "悟空看着大家滑来滑去。\n“看！会飞的脚！”\n“我也想试试！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "81f190f63df44f13d317ae838741c7df8c56cd1b6686c32d6f2237fa304b0fb5",
      "text": "他穿上冰鞋。\n咚，咚。\n“我的脚上长了小雪橇！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "899608af14a9cd46ac8f46a17cc6d5712907e6b1bd2fc14cb9ad0b6bf31953ea",
      "text": "戴好头盔，戴好手套。\n水獭教练检查好冰鞋。\n“准备好迈小步了吗？”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "80612a358f05ada04719dadcc1c74adce5125265175e828a9bbfea63433fb5fd",
      "text": "悟空走上冰面。\n两只脚滑开了。\n“脚呀，等等我！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "34236123ac0f65cb92d689c78d57d5bb6a78bd5ecdf9dc10092a450f9f23a81f",
      "text": "哎哟！他摔了一跤。\n一屁股坐在冰上。\n“你好呀，凉凉的地板。”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "02eb99b02910d8e2c35302150014e7915ed406deed9c90af0f1988164fe74430",
      "text": "“学东西要多练习。”\n水獭教练说，\n“我们一起站起来。”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "1ec17753847d3959a0c113814636371d47baa756f06314ee5193d4ff349d7c78",
      "text": "迈小步，弯膝盖。\n“像小企鹅！”玉兔说。\n悟空一摇一摆，咯咯直笑。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "af3b09e435c7d6cf354a6af36a58f9e65332facc26ed2fffc5a79242bb675bc0",
      "text": "蹬……滑……\n蹬……滑……\n滑出去一点点！\n又滑出去一点点！",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "72fab30421c5211a406d3aa27679bcc4b7c8bc7fba1a189383b03bba625b2088",
      "text": "接着，他又摔了一跤。\n“我还以为已经学会了呢。”\n他坐到八戒旁边。\n“和我一起歇歇吧。”八戒说。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "902cca4a0c5210a24ba0f6677e1b2e5b4282cfcee1e4541b526c9d7a7a6c60dc",
      "text": "他们搓搓小手，\n看雪花轻轻地转着圈。\n“我要再试一次。”悟空说。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "4007b95538fddbf6900faebdfa35d0105e8a045ea2a82fa763a6994c1508c55c",
      "text": "悟空回到冰上，接着练。\n迈一小步，滑一小下，\n摇摇晃晃也没关系。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "ce697f70e26b2191d0c43a8504445d0b7148dc99379e993addd06a3f6f789ba6",
      "text": "慢慢地，他的脚找到了节奏。\n蹬……滑……\n蹬……滑……\n“看！我会滑啦！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "95d16fc5e39e275cc128ae8b03a2a2bcd19fb1418859adc69ccfd7e65be87984",
      "text": "他们慢慢滑着，绕了个圈。\n玉兔带头，八戒跟上，\n悟空也滑起来。\n六只冰鞋，滑得真开心！",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "52a42dc7797d752ed5864b0d23fecd4c2603add49ed40b83015f0a11612c919f",
      "text": "冰场的灯一闪一闪。\n“冰面，下次见！”\n他的脚累了，\n可他还在笑。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "e83e693253c59d2276663a912b53bd62999c5ffc251f028330c940c4ace841b6",
      "text": "悟空钻进被子里。\n梦里，\n他滑过一颗颗星星，\n慢慢地，轻轻地，\n一直滑进梦乡。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "289f1ec520e4ee3afd619415c1cb27295d9ced81c1cf804b8ba097d89c275be2",
